sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant UI as SplitOS UI
    participant RH as Runtime Host
    participant MS as Mode State
    participant MT as Mode Transition
    participant GS as Game Session
    participant MP as Mode Policy
    participant CTX as Work Context Owners
    participant PB as Privileged Broker
    participant WIN as Windows/Drivers
    participant DESK as Windows Desktop

    U->>UI: Switch to Work Mode
    UI->>RH: RequestOperationalMode(WORK)
    RH->>MS: Read committed mode
    MS-->>RH: GAME
    RH->>MT: Start transition GAME→WORK
    MT->>GS: Inspect current game session

    alt Active game/startup exists
        MT-->>UI: Confirmation/blocker details
        U->>UI: Close game and continue / Cancel
        alt Cancel
            UI->>MT: Cancel
            MT-->>MS: Keep GAME committed
        else Continue
            UI->>GS: Request supported game termination
            GS->>WIN: Observe actual exit evidence
            WIN-->>GS: Game ended
        end
    end

    MT->>MP: Resolve Work target policy
    MP->>CTX: Resolve display/audio/input/power/apps
    MT->>CTX: Apply Work context
    CTX->>WIN: User-session operations
    opt Privileged operation
        RH->>PB: Semantic machine-level command
        PB->>WIN: Apply privileged state
        WIN-->>PB: Technical result
    end

    CTX->>WIN: Read actual Work target evidence
    WIN-->>CTX: Actual state
    CTX-->>MT: Verification result

    alt Work verification passed
        MT->>MS: Commit WORK
        MS-->>MT: WORK committed
        MT->>GS: Converge to INACTIVE
        MT-->>DESK: Work UX ready
    else Verification failed
        MT->>CTX: Roll back to coherent GAME or safe fallback
        CTX->>WIN: Restore safe target
        MT-->>MS: Keep GAME or escalate recovery
    end